(5), uint8(50), false)\n            )\n        );\n\n        (bool ok, bytes memory rawBorrowState) = HyperCoreConstants.PRECOMPILE_SUPPLIED_BALANCE.staticcall(\n            abi.encode(address(vault), uint64(HyperCoreConstants.USDC_TOKEN_INDEX))\n        );\n        require(ok, \"borrow state read failed\");\n        (, uint64 borrowValue, , uint64 supplyValue) =\n            abi.decode(rawBorrowState, (uint64, uint64, uint64, uint64));\n        assertEq(borrowValue, omittedBorrowDebtL1, \"0x811 exposes USDC borrow liability\");\n        assertEq(supplyValue, 0, \"USDC is debt-only in the borrow/lend state\");\n\n        int256 reportedBefore = accountant.totalBackingSigned();\n        assertEq(reportedBefore, int256(depositAmount + omittedBorrowDebt), \"supply counted, borrow ignored\");\n        assertEq(accountant.distributableSurplus(), int256(omittedBorrowDebt), \"phantom surplus\");\n        assertEq(\n            reportedBefore - int256(omittedBorrowDebt),\n            int256(usdm.totalSupply()),\n            \"real backing is only exactly solvent before settlement\"\n        );\n\n        vm.warp(block.timestamp + 4 days);\n\n        vm.startPrank(operator);\n        vault.settle(omittedBorrowDebt);\n        vault.distributeYield();\n        vm.stopPrank();\n\n        uint256 userShare = (omittedBorrowDebt * config.userYieldBps()) / 10000;\n        uint256 insuranceShare = (omittedBorrowDebt * config.insuranceYieldBps()) / 10000;\n        uint256 foundationShare = omittedBorrowDebt - userShare - insuranceShare;\n\n        assertEq(usdm.totalSupply(), depositAmount + userShare, \"phantom USDM minted\");\n        assertEq(\n            usdc.balanceOf(address(vault)),\n            depositAmount - insuranceShare - foundationShare,\n            \"real USDC routed out of backing\"\n        );\n\n        int256 reportedAfter = accountant.totalBackingSigned();\n        int256 realBackingAfter = reportedAfter - int256(omittedBorrowDebt);\n\n        assertEq(reportedAfter, int256(usdm.totalSupply()), \"reported solvency hides borrow debt\");\n        assertLt(realBackingAfter, int256(usdm.totalSupply()), \"real backing < USDM supply\");\n        assertEq(\n            int256(usdm.totalSupply()) - realBackingAfter,\n            int256(omittedBorrowDebt),\n            \"deficit equals omitted PM borrow liability\"\n        );\n    }\n}\n```\n\nRun:\n\n```shell\nforge test --match-path test/c4/PmBorrowLiabilitiesBacking.t.sol \\\n  --match-test test_pmBorrowLiabilityInflatesBackingAndDistributesPhantomYield \\\n  -vvv\n```\n\nObserved output:\n\n```text\nRan 1 test for test/c4/PmBorrowLiabilitiesBacking.t.sol:PmBorrowLiabilitiesBackingPoC\n[PASS] test_pmBorrowLiabilityInflatesBackingAndDistributesPhantomYield() (gas: 1698872)\nSuite result: ok. 1 passed; 0 failed; 0 skipped\n\nRan 1 test suite: 1 tests passed, 0 failed, 0 skipped (1 total tests)\n```",
